      "party": "Democratic",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Summer Lee is the incumbent U.S. Representative for Pennsylvania's 12th Congressional District, first elected in 2022 and now seeking a third term. A progressive Democrat and member of the informal 'Squad' caucus, she previously served in the Pennsylvania House of Representatives from 2019 to 2022 and made history as the first Black woman elected to Congress from Pennsylvania. She serves on the House Oversight and Government Reform Committee and the Education and Workforce Committee.",
